# Source stays diffable. Without this, one stray control byte reclassifies a
# file as binary for good: `git diff` and `git blame` stop working on it, and a
# merge conflict can only be resolved whole-file instead of hunk by hunk.
*.py    text diff
*.ts    text diff
*.tsx   text diff
*.js    text diff
*.mjs   text diff
*.css   text diff
*.json  text diff
*.md    text diff
*.toml  text diff
*.yml   text diff
*.yaml  text diff

# The committed UI bundle is build output, not source. Checked out exactly as
# committed: nobody edits or diffs it by hand, and rewriting line endings in
# generated chunks makes every rebuild look like a change to files that only
# differ by their endings.
src/camoufox_pm/webui/** -text
